      "id": 1479489716279,
      "title": "R-Type Dimensions EX Collector's Edition (Nintendo Switch)",
      "handle": "r-type-dimensions-ex-collectors-edition-nintendo-switch",
      "body_html": "<p>R-Type Dimensions EX Collector's Edition (Nintendo Switch).</p>\n<p><strong>Strictly Limited Games exclusive, l</strong><strong>imited to 2000 copies worldwide, i</strong><strong>ndividually numbered.</strong> We ship internationally. Max. 2 per customer</p>\n<p>One of the best SHMUP series of all time! R-Type Dimension EX brings you the Arcade Legends R-Type &amp; R-Type II back in new HD 3D graphics, including all original levels.</p>\n<p><strong>Collector's Edition Contents</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>R-Type Dimensions EX Game (Nintendo Switch)</li>\n<li>Exclusive Hardcover Artbook</li>\n<li>R-Type Dog Tag</li>\n<li>Mini Marquee Stickers</li>\n<li>R-Type Cards</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Approximate size of the Collector's Edition box:<span> 22cm x 16cm x 6,5cm (8,7 x 6,3 x 2,6 inches)</span></strong></p>\n<p> <strong>Age Rating</strong><br></p>\n<p>This game has been rated ages 6 and up by the German Entertainment Software Self-Regulation Body (USK). There is no age rating printed or stickered on the box. <br></p>\n<p>German customers must be at least 18 years old to order and receive the shipment. This does not apply to international customers.</p>",
