      "handle": "velocity-2x-collectors-edition-nintendo-switch",
      "body_html": "<p><span>Velocity 2X Collector's Edition (Nintendo Switch).</span></p>\n<p><strong>Strictly Limited Games exclusive, l</strong><strong>imited to 1500 copies worldwide, i</strong><strong>ndividually numbered.</strong> We ship internationally. <span>Max. 2 per customer</span></p>\n<p><em>Velocity 2X is a Sci-Fi Arcade Action Game! Fight<span> </span>the evil Vokh as Lt. Kai Tama with your powerful Quarp Jet or on foot through sidescrolling missions.</em></p>\n<p> <strong>The Collector's Edition contains:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Velocity 2X (Nintendo Switch)</li>\n<li>Velocity 2X Soundtrack CD</li>\n<li>Artbook</li>\n<li>Poster</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Approximate size of the Collector's Edition box:<span> 22cm x 16cm x 6,5cm (8,7 x 6,3 x 2,6 inches)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Please note:</strong> </p>\n<p><em>This game has been rated USK 6+ by the German Entertainment Software Self-Regulation Body (USK).<span> </span><span>There is no age rating printed or stickered on the box.</span><span> The age rating is only shown on the disk.</span></em><br><em>German customers must be at least 18 years old to order and receive the shipment. This does not apply to international customers.</em></p>",
