    {
      "id": 1430681255991,
      "title": "Fox N Forests Collector's Edition (Nintendo Switch)",
      "handle": "fox-n-forests-collectors-edition-nintendo-switch",
      "body_html": "<p>Fox N Forests Collector's Edition (Nintendo Switch).</p>\n<p><strong>Strictly Limited Games exclusive, l</strong><strong>imited to 1000 copies worldwide, i</strong><strong>ndividually numbered.</strong> We ship internationally.<span> </span><span>Max. </span><span>2</span><span> copy</span><span> of this version per customer.</span></p>\n<p>FOX n FORESTS is a 16-bit style action platformer with RPG elements! Switch seasons on the fly and wield your crossbow to unveil the mystery of the 5th season.</p>\n<p><strong>The Collector's Edition contains:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fox N Forests Game (Nintendo Switch)</li>\n<li>Fox N Forest Soundtrack CD</li>\n<li>Artbook</li>\n<li>Stickersheet</li>\n<li>Poster</li>\n<li>Postcard Set</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Size of the Collector's Edition box:<span> 22cm x 16cm x 6,5cm (8,7 x 6,3 x 2,6 inches)</span></strong></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Age Rating:</strong><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">This game has been rated ages<span> </span>6<span> </span>and up by by the German Entertainment Software Self-Regulation Body (USK). There is no age rating printed or stickered on the box.<br></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">German customers must be at least 18 years old to order and receive the shipment. This does not apply to international customers.</p>",
